<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Dear customer, <o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I&#8217;d like to introduce myself&#8212;I'm Ayana M=
uratova, your <b>Success Manager</b> at Amadeus.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I&#8217;ll be working closely with your <b>Account M=
anager</b> James Kabuga in Kenya to support you every step of the way.<o:p>=
</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">From time to time, you&#8217;ll receive emails from =
me with helpful updates and insights based on our ongoing work together.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">These messages are designed to keep you informed and=
 supported&#8212;whether it&#8217;s sharing:<o:p></o:p></p>
