so-list:l0 level1 lfo1">or opportunities tailored to your goals.<o:p></o:p>=
</li></ul>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">We also produce different videos for you with releva=
nt topics that you can watch on our team portal:<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><a href=3D"https://campaign.amadeus.com/power_up_web=
inar">Amadeus Power-Up your business</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">I&#8217;d love to introduce myself and suggest a qui=
ck call so we can get to know each other better.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>&#8212;just reply with a time that works for you.=
<o:p></o:p></b></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Looking forward to working together!<o:p></o:p></p>
